{
  "_comment": [
    "The console keyboard layout: a oneshot service that loads the keymap",
    "Machine\\System\\Console Keymap names (/usr/libexec/kbd/apply-keymap).",
    "",
    "Triggers boot, and runs again whenever it is restarted, which is how a",
    "changed value takes effect without a reboot: System Settings writes the",
    "value and restarts this service.",
    "",
    "Identity SYSTEM, because loading a keymap is a console operation the",
    "kernel allows only to a process with the console as its own terminal or",
    "with the TTY-configuration privilege, and a service has no terminal.",
    "Type Oneshot (1), Readiness Alive (1), RestartPolicy Never (0): it runs,",
    "loads, and exits. ErrorControl Normal (0): a machine with no virtual",
    "console, or a bad value, logs a warning and boots on the built-in US",
    "layout.",
    "",
    "The Console key is created with no Keymap, which is the built-in US",
    "layout.",
    "",
    "Shipped by org.kernel.kbd into /usr/share/regim/; inert until an image",
    "names it in [registry] autoapply."
  ],
  "keys": [
    { "path": "Machine\\System" },
    { "path": "Machine\\System\\Services" },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Services\\console-keymap",
      "values": [
        { "name": "ImagePath", "type": "sz", "data": "/usr/libexec/kbd/apply-keymap" },
        { "name": "Type", "type": "dword", "data": 1 },
        { "name": "Triggers", "type": "multi", "data": ["boot"] },
        { "name": "Identity", "type": "sz", "data": "SYSTEM" },
        { "name": "Readiness", "type": "dword", "data": 1 },
        { "name": "RestartPolicy", "type": "dword", "data": 0 },
        { "name": "ErrorControl", "type": "dword", "data": 0 },
        { "name": "DisplayName", "type": "sz", "data": "Console keyboard layout" },
        {
          "name": "Description",
          "type": "sz",
          "data": "Loads the console keyboard layout Machine\\System\\Console Keymap names"
        }
      ]
    },
    { "path": "Machine\\System\\Console" }
  ]
}
